{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都にて全国握手会でしたっ！\nきてくださった方ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライヴのダンス、いつもキレキレを心がけているのですがみなさんちゃんと見てくださっていて嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンはまりちゃんと！\nいこまはいつもまりかのことをまりちゃんと呼ぶ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてゆったんお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんもうハタチなんだね〜\nまだ高校生って感じがするよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんはいつも乃木坂にキラキラした空気を届けてくれる！\nだからみんなどよ〜んとしている時も不思議と元気になるんだよね！\nおしゃれだし動きが可愛いし！\nハタチで大人だけどそんな小動物のようなゆったんでいてね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんのおしりすきよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では！\nお留守のみなさんお待ちかねのエアー握手会開催するよっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/07/21/0227583/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっぷ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまた会う日までね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}